Nene, ni te imaginas.

164
00:11:44,078 --> 00:11:47,164
-Bésame.
-¿Qué? ¿Aquí?

165
00:11:47,415 --> 00:11:51,085
No temas explorar
nuevos horizontes.

166
00:12:00,177 --> 00:12:02,221
